  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Programme to Accelerate the Reduction of Transmission of the HIV and Tuberculosis Epidemic and to improve Malaria Management in Burundi (PACTEAPEC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">The overall objective of the Global Fund-funded grant is to contribute to the achievement of the goals, objectives and results of the National Strategic Plans for the fight against AIDS, Tuberculosis and Malaria in Burundi (according to the different National Strategic Plans of the different Programs). This is an important opportunity to consolidate the gains and accelerate the response towards the elimination of the three diseases in Burundi.</narrative>
  </description>
